### Login (obtenha o token)
POST http://localhost:8081/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "seu-usuario", "password": "sua-senha" }

### Listar clientes
GET http://localhost:8081/clients/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <cole-o-token-aqui>

### Buscar cliente por ID
GET http://localhost:8081/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <cole-o-token-aqui>

### Criar cliente
POST http://localhost:8081/clients/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <cole-o-token-aqui>

{ "name": "Empresa X", "email": "contato@empresax.com" }

### Atualizar cliente
PUT http://localhost:8081/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <cole-o-token-aqui>

{ "name": "Empresa X Ltda", "email": "contato@empresax.com" }

### Excluir cliente
DELETE http://localhost:8081/clients/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <cole-o-token-aqui>
